usage: verify.py [-h] [--workspace WORKSPACE] --output OUTPUT
                 [--local-package-probes | --authority-probe |
                 --query-api-package-probe]

Verify the frozen EventStore producer; run only through run-with-temp. No
publication, submodule initialization, or shared checkout mutation occurs.
Every invocation requires a new output directory so failures remain preserved.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --workspace WORKSPACE
  --output OUTPUT
  --local-package-probes
                        Supplement the baseline with real unpublished manifest
                        packages and the skipped package probe bodies.
  --authority-probe     Reproduce the package-authority scan once with its
                        original eight-minute bound.
  --query-api-package-probe
                        Pack only the real Contracts/Client/generator archives
                        and compile a synthetic query consumer.
